  Merged by Tauri into the Info.plist of the macOS app. Without a usage description macOS never shows its microphone prompt (and a page that
  asks for the microphone gets a silent refusal). Edit the sentence for your app; it is what the user reads in the prompt.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>This app uses the microphone when one of its features asks for it (for example voice dialogue).</string>
</dict>
</plist>
